# .gitignore — additions on top of what you already have
.env
.env.*
**/target/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.db
.vscode/
*.zip
*.pdf
misc
*.pem
eai-project-key

# NEW — Terraform state/caches. .terraform/ is regeneratable via `terraform init`;
# *.tfstate can contain plaintext resource attributes (including, after Phase 5,
# the RDS password if you ever inspect state locally) — Terraform Cloud already
# holds the real state remotely, so nothing of value is lost by ignoring local copies.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

*.class
*.jar
